Note, Pick a random word.
Let word count be the length of words.
Let wordid be a random number between 1 and the value of word count.
Let word be item the value of wordid of words.
Let word length be the length of word.

Note, Game state.
Create a list called guessed letters.
Let lives be 6.
Let solved be no.

Note, Main game loop.
While the value of lives is greater than 0 and the value of solved is equal to no,

    Note, Show the word letter by letter, dot for unknown letters.
    Say Word so far colon.
    Let position be 1.
    While the value of position is less than or equal to the value of word length,
        Let current letter be the substring of word from the value of position to the value of position.
        If the value of guessed letters contains the value of current letter,
            Say the value of current letter.
        Otherwise,
            Say unknown.
        End if.
        Add 1 to position.
    End while.

    Say Lives remaining.
    Say the value of lives.

    Ask for guess with the message Guess a letter.
    Let guess be the lowercase of guess.

    If the value of guessed letters contains the value of guess,
        Say You already tried that letter.
    Otherwise,
        Add the value of guess to guessed letters.

        Let guess position be the position of the value of guess in word.
        If the value of guess position is equal to 0,
            Say Wrong.
            Subtract 1 from lives.
        Otherwise,
            Say Correct.
        End if.
    End if.

    Note, Check whether every letter has been found.
    Let all found be yes.
    Let check position be 1.
    While the value of check position is less than or equal to the value of word length,
        Let check letter be the substring of word from the value of check position to the value of check position.
        If the value of guessed letters contains the value of check letter,
            Note, letter already known.
        Otherwise,
            Let all found be no.
        End if.
        Add 1 to check position.
    End while.
    Let solved be the value of all found.

End while.

If the value of solved is equal to yes,
    Say You win.
Otherwise,
    Say You lose.
End if.

Say The word was.
Say the value of word.